Tax-efficient charitable giving as the Globe and Mail lays it out lets you transfer appreciated

00:01:53.105 --> 00:01:58.765
securities in-kind to a registered charity so you never realize the capital gain, and

00:01:58.765 --> 00:02:01.665
you still deduct the full current market value on your return.

00:02:02.265 --> 00:02:04.585
Picture a bottle that has aged well in the seller.

00:02:05.085 --> 00:02:09.545
